# An Interval of Integers in practice; its collect: and select: answer Arrays (species).
class Interval
super SequenceableCollection[Integer]
ivar start <Number>
ivar stop <Number>
ivar step <Number>
method at: <Integer> ^<Integer>
method collect: <[Integer, ^X]> ^<Array[X]>
method select: <[Integer, ^Boolean]> ^<Array[Integer]>
method do: <[Integer, ^Dynamic]> ^<Self>
method first ^<Integer>
method last ^<Integer>
method increment ^<Number>
method size ^<Integer>
method species ^<Behavior>
method setFrom: <Number> to: <Number> by: <Number> ^<Self>
meta from: <Number> to: <Number> ^<Instance>
meta from: <Number> to: <Number> by: <Number> ^<Instance>
